  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Global objectives on girls&apos; education (AR No. 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the second report to be produced on the Global Objectives.  The first report was a baseline report, published in November 2022 and written by UIS, GEMR and UNGEI - and the approach to this report differs this year, in that the report will be written by a consultant from an external organisation and selected by the organisation. The global data will be provided by the UN Institute of Statistics (UIS) and Global Education Monitoring Report (GEMR) and the supplier will pull together the narrative in consultation with the UN Girls&#x2019; Education Initiative (UNGEI), UIS/ GEMR, the FCDO and additional experts on education.</narrative>
  </description>
